  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/CarreraPopularSantCristofolRibesalbes17.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Carrera popular a benefici de l&#39;Associaci&oacute; Espanyola contra el C&agrave;ncer,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/ZumbaSantCristofolRibesalbes17.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>masterclass de zumba a c&agrave;rrec de Leticia Albalat i Ana Peris.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/PlacaAlcaldeAntonioVallsPruñonosa.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>I la part m&eacute;s emotiva: descrobrimet d&#39;una placa a la porta de l&#39;edifici s&ograve;cio-cultural en mem&ograve;ria de l&#39;ex-alcalde Antonio Valls Pru&ntilde;onosa, mort tr&agrave;gicament a l&#39;agost de 2015.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sancristofolribesalbes17/img_6902.jpg\" alt=\"img_6902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sancristofolribesalbes17/img_6905.jpg\" alt=\"img_6905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sancristofolribesalbes17/img_6906.jpg\" alt=\"img_6906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sancristofolribesalbes17/img_6907.jpg\" alt=\"img_6907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sancristofolribesalbes17/img_6911.jpg\" alt=\"img_6911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sancristofolribesalbes17/img_6913.jpg\" alt=\"img_6913\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https: